Date: Mon, 25 May 2026 23:06:51 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 6/7] feat(debian): add DeviceTest XML configs and update
 kickpi-hardware

- Add DeviceTestConfig XML files for all supported boards (k3/k3b/k11c/k1/k1Mini/k1b/k8/k8d)
- Add generic DeviceTestConfig.xml as default config
- Remove deprecated INI configs (k11c, k1mini)
- Update kickpi-hardware to copy board-specific or default DeviceTestConfig.xml
- Update DeviceTest binary with XML parsing support and English UI matching
- Fix board detection order in kickpi-hardware (k8d/k8/k10b before k3)
- Add explicit XML comment skipping in DeviceTest parser

Origin: kickpi 18cfd8cdb3be5a5e00629117abfd06068f5fcd52
